---
import Layout from "../../components/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout lang="en" title="About | Baitaan" description="Who makes Baitaan.">
  <article class="space-y-4 leading-relaxed text-ink">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink">About</h1>
    <p>Baitaan is a MAAF Studios project. We build free calculators that follow Brazilian law and work without sign-up.</p>
    <p>The English pages are a translation to help people who don't read Portuguese. The calculations are for jobs in Brazil under the CLT.</p>
    <p>Each calculator shows its official source and the date it was last updated. Found a mistake? Write to ola@baitaandessigns.com.</p>
  </article>
</Layout>
